{"hw":"θεία","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">θεία</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">θεία</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one's father's</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">mother's sister, aunt,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">POxy.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">274.5</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(i A.D.)</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ammon.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Diff.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.130</span> </span> V., etc. (Late formation fr. <span class=\"gk\">θεῖος</span> (B), replacing <span class=\"gk\">τηθίς</span>.)</div></div>"}